{"3096230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DOGENSTEIN", "steam_appid": 3096230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO THE ULTIMATE SATIRE OF POLITICAL CORRECTNESS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a wild, hilarious ride! Take on the crazy &quot;WOKE&quot; warriors who’ve captured the world and enforced their absurd ideology. Push back against corporate political correctness and prove common sense still wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/9df886b2a6e40a69bbc5d436ec1676c2.avif?t=1786655697\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of DOGENSTEIN takes place in a world consumed by totalitarian &quot;WOKE&quot; rule. It is governed with an iron fist by a ruthless oligarch known only as the Prince, who has seized control of corporations, the media, and the entire state.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every pocket of resistance has been wiped out. Anyone who dares oppose the imposed ideology is marked for destruction. Dissidents are literally ground into mountains of putrid biomass.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world has completely lost its mind. Common sense has been outlawed. Only one mission remains: fight your way through this nightmare and bring down the empire of &quot;WOKE&quot; absurdity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TIME HAS COME - IT'S TIME TO FIGHT BACK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world has fallen under the Prince's rule and the control of his loyal &quot;WOKE&quot; puppets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But one dog refused to submit. Carve your way through endless hordes of enemies, tear down the empire of absurdity, and dive into the most insane, fast-paced boomer shooter you've ever played!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/bef5cb4daf26831ea75c2c872bc78dca.avif?t=1786655697\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blast your way through 13 action-packed levels, each filled with unique gags, chaotic set pieces, hidden secrets, and memorable moments.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle armies of ideological &quot;WOKE&quot; fanatics and champions of cancel culture as you bring their politically correct empire crashing down.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the fearless BULLDOG and challenge the Prince's regime.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lightning-fast retro FPS inspired by the golden age of 1990s shooters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the twisted world of &quot;Cancel Culture&quot; - prisons, cities, human-processing factories, and other bizarre locations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy authentic old-school pixel art inspired by classic retro shooters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An electrifying Retrowave soundtrack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, edgy, and absurdly funny dialogue packed with dark humor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO THE ULTIMATE SATIRE OF POLITICAL CORRECTNESS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a wild, hilarious ride! Take on the crazy &quot;WOKE&quot; warriors who’ve captured the world and enforced their absurd ideology. Push back against corporate political correctness and prove common sense still wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/9df886b2a6e40a69bbc5d436ec1676c2.avif?t=1786655697\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of DOGENSTEIN takes place in a world consumed by totalitarian &quot;WOKE&quot; rule. It is governed with an iron fist by a ruthless oligarch known only as the Prince, who has seized control of corporations, the media, and the entire state.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every pocket of resistance has been wiped out. Anyone who dares oppose the imposed ideology is marked for destruction. Dissidents are literally ground into mountains of putrid biomass.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world has completely lost its mind. Common sense has been outlawed. Only one mission remains: fight your way through this nightmare and bring down the empire of &quot;WOKE&quot; absurdity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TIME HAS COME - IT'S TIME TO FIGHT BACK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world has fallen under the Prince's rule and the control of his loyal &quot;WOKE&quot; puppets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But one dog refused to submit. Carve your way through endless hordes of enemies, tear down the empire of absurdity, and dive into the most insane, fast-paced boomer shooter you've ever played!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/bef5cb4daf26831ea75c2c872bc78dca.avif?t=1786655697\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blast your way through 13 action-packed levels, each filled with unique gags, chaotic set pieces, hidden secrets, and memorable moments.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle armies of ideological &quot;WOKE&quot; fanatics and champions of cancel culture as you bring their politically correct empire crashing down.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the fearless BULLDOG and challenge the Prince's regime.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lightning-fast retro FPS inspired by the golden age of 1990s shooters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the twisted world of &quot;Cancel Culture&quot; - prisons, cities, human-processing factories, and other bizarre locations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy authentic old-school pixel art inspired by classic retro shooters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An electrifying Retrowave soundtrack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, edgy, and absurdly funny dialogue packed with dark humor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "WELCOME TO SATIRE ON SATIRE! Take on the crazy &quot;WOKE&quot; warriors destroying the world and enforcing their absurd ideology in this hilariously fast-paced retro FPS. Control the fearless